---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StickyCTA from "../../components/StickyCTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partnership Benefits | Vision 8:28"
  description="Partnership with Vision 8:28 is not transactional. It is intentionally transformational."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white py-32 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Why Partner With Vision 8:28?
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Partnership with Vision 8:28 is not transactional. It is intentionally transformational.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a
              href="/partnership/join"
              class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
            >
              Become a Partner
            </a>
            <a
              href="#benefits"
              class="inline-block bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors duration-200"
            >
              Explore Partnership Benefits
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          When you partner with Vision 8:28 and its network of partnerships, you gain access to a structured, high-performance ecosystem designed to deliver measurable community and economic outcomes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="benefits" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            What Partnership Delivers
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Six dimensions of value — each designed to accelerate your organization's impact and visibility.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Strategic Visibility</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Position your organization as a leader in community and economic transformation. Be recognized alongside the region's most impactful institutions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Policy & Thought Leadership Access</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Engage directly in advocacy conversations shaping regional development. Bring your expertise to the table where it matters most.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Workforce & Pipeline Access</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Connect with emerging entrepreneurs, talent pipelines, and high-impact economic development initiatives positioned for growth.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Data-Driven Insights</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Receive curated research, reports, and economic intelligence to inform decision-making and strengthen your organization's strategy.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Collaborative Capital Leverage</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Access aligned capital strategies across public, private, and philanthropic sectors — amplifying what your investment can achieve.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#24a4b9] bg-opacity-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Brand Alignment With Impact</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Be publicly recognized as a catalyst for education, entrepreneurship, and economic mobility — aligning your brand with transformational outcomes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Partnership Tiers
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Each tier includes increasing visibility, leadership seats, event access, and advisory influence.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-400/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Founding Partner</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Maximum leadership access and co-founding recognition</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-[#24a4b9]/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#24a4b9]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Strategic Partner</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Priority advisory seats and co-branded initiatives</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-slate-500/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Corporate Partner</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Event access, visibility, and workforce alignment</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-slate-500/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Community Partner</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Directory listing and collaborative program access</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-slate-500/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Institutional Partner</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Academic and research alignment with regional strategy</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
          Ready to See the Full Picture?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-10">
          Download our partnership overview or speak directly with our team about strategic alignment.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/partnership/join"
            class="inline-block bg-[#24a4b9] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#1d8a9d] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
          >
            Schedule A Strategic Partnership Call
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-block border-2 border-slate-300 text-slate-700 px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Download Partnership Overview
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <StickyCTA
      title="Partner With Vision 8:28"
      description="Join a cross-sector alliance committed to community resilience and regional growth."
      ctaText="Become a Partner"
      ctaHref="/partnership/join"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
